@FinanceTracker.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5296

GET {{FinanceTracker.API_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### UC-17..UC-20 (a {{token}} a /api/auth/login válaszából jön; a modellkezelő végpontokhoz üzemeltetői fiók kell)
@token = <JWT>

POST {{FinanceTracker.API_HostAddress}}/api/categorization/predict
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "Expense", "description": "Lidl Budapest" }

###

POST {{FinanceTracker.API_HostAddress}}/api/categorization/models/train
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

GET {{FinanceTracker.API_HostAddress}}/api/categorization/models
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### UC-21..UC-24 (a {{token}} ugyanaz a JWT; az időszak mindkét napja beletartozik, megadás nélkül az aktuális hónap)
GET {{FinanceTracker.API_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/overview?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

GET {{FinanceTracker.API_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/categories?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

GET {{FinanceTracker.API_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/compare?baseFrom=2026-10-01&baseTo=2026-10-31&comparedFrom=2026-11-01&comparedTo=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

